# TypeScript's incremental build cache. Rewritten by every `tsc` and
# `next build`, so versioning it means a machine-specific binary blob in the
# diff of unrelated PRs. Untracked via `git rm --cached` in SPM-39.
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md are tracked. `next dev` keeps only the block between
# the nextjs-agent-rules markers in AGENTS.md up to date, and leaves CLAUDE.md
# alone while AGENTS.md exists, so the project's own instructions in CLAUDE.md
# stay put. Untracking AGENTS.md would make `next dev` write its block into
# CLAUDE.md on a fresh clone.
"*.tsbuildinfo" 

